BIT ROUTINES - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

              2         IDT  'BITF'
              3  *
              4  *
              5  * ROUTINE LIST:
              6  *
              7  *       BITF                   BIT FUNCTION
              8  *       BITY                   BIT COMMAND
              9  *
             10         REF  EVSFR$             RELOAD R2 & EXIT TO EVALUATOR
             11         REF  NLIN               EXIT TO MULTIPLEXOR
             12         REF  EVERZ              EVALUATE EXPRESSION
             13         REF  GPRM1              GET-PARAMETER ENTRY
             14         REF  FPAC2              
             15         REF  B4A
             16         DXOP STORE,1            STORE FPAC
             17         DXOP EVFIX,11           EVALUATE AND FIX
             18         DXOP OUTFP,12           OUT FLOATING POINT #
     2F80    19  ERROR  EQU  >2F80              XOP XX,14  (ERROR CALL)
             20         DEF  BITY               ENTRY POINT FOR BIT STATEMENT
             21         DEF  BITF               ENTRY POINT FOR BIT FUNCTION
             22         DEF  C8000
